        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 653, Springfield Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 4 Inch Flush Pull from Omnia hardware is available in  contemporary finishes. The Springfield Rectangular Flush Pull features hidden screw mounting, for a modern look once installed. The Springfield Rectangular Flush Pull is easy to grasp and has an impressive appearance. For use on pocket doors, closet doors, barn doors, or any type of sliding door where a flush with the door face pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 653 4 Inch Springfield Rectangular Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting nails</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/653-template.pdf?v=1704262259\"><b>Omnia 653 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
